GT911 TOUCH TEST

Bring-up UI for the capacitive overlay on the 4.3" 800x480 panel (P4 CTP
flex, Goodix GT911 on I2C2).

    game start touchtest     # LCD switches to the grid
    game stop                # back to the dashboard / getty

Or, if you are already on the LCD console:

    touchtest

Tap the four corner rings. They turn green; all four show PASS. A coloured
dot follows each contact (up to five), and a short trail is left behind so
you can see whether X/Y are swapped or inverted.

    q        quit (or `game stop` from SSH/UART)
    c        clear trail and corner hits
    -x -y    invert an axis without rebuilding
    -s       swap X/Y in userspace
    -d DEV   force an evdev node

If the banner says NO TOUCH DEVICE the kernel never bound the GT911:

    dmesg | grep -iE 'goodix|gt911'
    ls /sys/bus/i2c/devices/
    i2cdetect -y 2
    evtest
